# ── Secrets & Credentials (reinforces global gitignore) ──
# KEEP IN SYNC with global gitignore: ~/git/unix/ba_flakes_desktop/src/modules/programs/git.nix
#                                      ~/git/unix/bb_flakes_termux/src/modules/programs/git.nix
## Decrypted secrets output
.secrets
*.secrets
**/.secrets
.secrets.d/
**/.secrets.d/
## Environment files
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
## Private keys & certificates
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
## Auth tokens & credentials
*.token
*credentials*.json
*_token.json
*_tokens.json
## Cloud provider configs
.oci/
.gcloud/
## GPG & age
*.asc
*.age
!*.age.pub
## Terraform secrets
terraform.tfvars
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example

# ── Repo-specific ──
## Large build artifacts - keep folders via .gitkeep
libs/**
libs/*
libs/
## EXCEPTION: 1_workflows/src/libs/ is engine source code, NOT build artifacts.
## Same convention as the cloud repo. Added 2026-05-16 after the engine broke
## because inject-header.sh was ignored despite being referenced by build.sh.
!1_workflows/src/libs/
!1_workflows/src/libs/**
## EXCEPTION: ea_cloud-superapp/libs/ is the gradle multi-module source tree
## (libs:core, libs:mail, libs:cal, …). Each is its own Android library
## with build.gradle + src/. NOT build artifacts. Added 2026-05-29 when
## the scaffold landed and these files silently disappeared on git add;
## renamed from ea_superapp → ea_cloud-superapp 2026-05-30.
!ea_cloud-superapp/libs/
!ea_cloud-superapp/libs/**
## Signing keystores are generated in CI only — never vendored.
ea_cloud-superapp/**/*.keystore
ea_cloud-superapp/**/*.jks
ea_cloud-comms/**/*.keystore
ea_cloud-comms/**/*.jks
ea_cloud-ide/**/*.keystore
ea_cloud-ide/**/*.jks
ea_cloud-nav/**/*.keystore
ea_cloud-nav/**/*.jks
## Fork-clone workspace: build.json::forks.<key>.tracker_dir materializes the
## upstream clones here (Mattermost / FairEmail / Fossify / Element-X) via
## `build.sh materialize-fork`. Huge third-party trees — NEVER vendored. OUR
## changes live as git-am patch series in ea_cloud-comms/forks/<key>/patches/
## (tracked). Was covered by the old `ea_*-*/` blanket rule, removed 2026-07-10.
ea_upstreams-sources/
ea_cloud-wallet/**/*.keystore
ea_cloud-wallet/**/*.jks
ea_cloud-browser/**/*.keystore
ea_cloud-browser/**/*.jks
ea_cloud-vault/**/*.keystore
ea_cloud-vault/**/*.jks
## Re-ignore Gradle build outputs inside the whitelisted ea_cloud-ide/ tree
## (the !ea_cloud-ide/** whitelist would otherwise track build/.gradle dirs).
## Added 2026-06-13.
ea_cloud-ide/.gradle/
ea_cloud-ide/build/
ea_cloud-ide/**/build/
ea_cloud-nav/.gradle/
ea_cloud-nav/build/
ea_cloud-nav/**/build/
## Re-ignore Gradle/Kotlin daemon caches inside the whitelisted ea_cloud-superapp/
## tree — same class of gap as the .gradle/build re-ignores above. Missing this
## let a local `./gradlew` run's Go-module dependency cache (.cache/gopath/...,
## from gvisor via some transitive Gradle plugin) and Kotlin compiler session
## files (.kotlin/sessions/...) get git-added and pushed as a ~3M-line commit
## (264c09f2, 2026-07-03). These are machine-local build caches, never vendored.
ea_cloud-superapp/.cache/
ea_cloud-superapp/.kotlin/
## Re-ignore build OUTPUTS inside the whitelisted Android projects — the
## !ea_cloud-*/** whitelists would otherwise make a locally-built APK / dist/
## tree committable (each APK is ~6-40 MB). Build artifacts are published to
## GHCR + GH Releases by the ship workflows, never vendored in git.
ea_cloud-superapp/dist/
ea_cloud-superapp/**/*.apk
ea_cloud-comms/dist/
ea_cloud-comms/**/*.apk
ea_cloud-ide/dist/
ea_cloud-ide/**/*.apk
ea_cloud-nav/dist/
ea_cloud-nav/**/*.apk
ea_cloud-wallet/dist/
ea_cloud-wallet/**/*.apk
ea_cloud-browser/dist/
ea_cloud-browser/**/*.apk
ea_cloud-vault/dist/
ea_cloud-vault/**/*.apk
## MyShell bundled nix store (500MB+)
ba_myshell/dist/*/_bundled/
ba_myshell/bin/
## Container storage
storage/
!storage/.gitkeep
## Disk images
*.raw
*.qcow2
*.iso
## Kernel/initrd
initrd.img
vmlinuz
*.img
## Nix build artifacts
a_nixos_host/result
## Desktop remote-build closure (GHA-built system tarball ~7GB — artifact only, never vendored)
aa_desk-usr_x86_surface-linux_nixos/dist-ci/
## Termux remote-build closure (GHA arm64-built nix-on-droid tarball — artifact only, never vendored)
bb_flakes_termux/dist-ci/
## Desktop home-manager remote-build closure (GHA x86-built tarball — artifact only, never vendored)
ba_flakes_desktop/dist-ci/
## Dev-store remote-build closure (GHA x86-built devProfile tarball → p5 chroot store — artifact only)
bc_flakes_dev-store/dist-ci/
## my-browser (qute) release binaries — built in CI, published to GitHub Releases, NEVER committed.
## The portable fork bundle (~640MB) and the standalone config tarball are artifacts only.
## (dist/*.html, dist/*-urls, dist/mybar.json ARE committed — those are small generated config.)
da_my-browser/dist/*.gz
da_my-browser/dist/*.tar.gz
